---
import LetterGlitch from "./letter-glitch.tsx";
---

<div>
	<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden border-b border-line">
		<div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 scale-[1.02] blur-[1px]">
			<LetterGlitch client:load glitchSpeed={100} smooth={true} />
		</div>
		<div
			class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28 lg:px-12 lg:py-36"
		>
			<div class="max-w-5xl">
				<p class="eyebrow">Nightmare Software / 01</p>
				<h1
					class="mt-6 max-w-5xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.065em] text-ink sm:text-7xl lg:text-[7.5rem]"
				>
					Make your unruly systems behave.
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-6 text-muted sm:text-xl">
					We keep the technology you depend on running cleanly and build the
					software your business needs.
				</p>
				<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
					<a href="/" class="button-primary">Start a Conversation ↗</a>
					<a href="/" class="button-outline">Explore Our Services</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<p
				class="mt-20 uppercase flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-muted text-[.68rem] tracking-[0.18em] sm:mt-28"
			>
				<span class="signal-dot" />
				Build / Support / Evolve
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="border-b border-line bg-surface">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl gap-10 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28">
			<h2
				class="max-w-md text-3xl font-medium leading-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl tracking=[-.04em]"
			>
				Technology should move at the speed of business.
			</h2>
			<p class="max-w-2xl text-lg text-muted sm:text-xl mt-10">
				Your tools should remove friction, not create another layer of it.<br>
				Nightmare Software partners with teams to turn tangled requirements into
				clear, durable systems — then stays close enough to keep things running
				smoothly.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="cta">
		<div
			class="mx-auto max-w-7xl gap-10 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28 grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-end lg:gap-20 lg:px-12"
		>
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">Ready when you are!</p>
				<h2
					class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-medium leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.055em] text-ink sm:text-6xl"
				>
					Bring us the hard stuff.
				</h2>
			</div>
			<div>
				<p class="text-base leading-7 text-purple-100/75">
					Tell us what is changing, what is stuck, or what needs to exist. We
					will help you find the next move.
				</p>
				<a href="/" class="button-light mt-8">Say hello ↗</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28 lg:px-12">
		<div
			class="mb-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:mb-14 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between"
		>
			<div>
				<div class="eyebrow">Capabilities 01 / 03</div>
				<h2
					class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-4xl font-medium tracking-tighter sm:text-6xl"
				>
					The hard parts, handled.
				</h2>
			</div>
			<a
				href="/"
				class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[.12em] text-muted uppercase underline decoration-line underline-offset-8 hover:text-ink"
				>View all services ↗</a
			>
		</div>
		<div>
			<a
				href="/"
				class="service-row group grid gap-5 py-7 sm:grid-cols-[5rem_1fr_auto] sm:items-center sm:gap-8 sm:py-8"
			>
				<span class="font-mono text-muted text-xs">01</span>
				<span>
					<span
						class="mb-2 block font-mono text-sm tracking-wider uppercase text-bright"
						>Managed IT</span
					>
					<strong
						class="block text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-.03em] text-ink sm:text-3xl"
						>Managed IT support</strong
					>
					<span class="mt-2 block max-w-2xl leading-7 text-muted"
						>Purpose-built solutions for the way your company actually
						works.</span
					>
				</span>
				<span class="service-arrow text-xl text-muted">↗</span>
			</a>
			<a
				href="/"
				class="service-row group grid gap-5 py-7 sm:grid-cols-[5rem_1fr_auto] sm:items-center sm:gap-8 sm:py-8"
			>
				<span class="font-mono text-muted text-xs">02</span>
				<span>
					<span
						class="mb-2 block font-mono text-sm tracking-wider uppercase text-bright"
						>Custom software</span
					>
					<strong
						class="block text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-.03em] text-ink sm:text-3xl"
						>Custom software development</strong
					>
					<span class="mt-2 block max-w-2xl leading-7 text-muted"
						>Calmer, more dependable technology operations for your team.</span
					>
				</span>
				<span class="service-arrow text-xl text-muted">↗</span>
			</a>
			<a
				href="/"
				class="service-row group grid gap-5 py-7 sm:grid-cols-[5rem_1fr_auto] sm:items-center sm:gap-8 sm:py-8"
			>
				<span class="font-mono text-muted text-xs">03</span>
				<span>
					<span
						class="mb-2 block font-mono text-sm tracking-wider uppercase text-bright"
						>Websites & integrations</span
					>
					<strong
						class="block text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-.03em] text-ink sm:text-3xl"
						>Websites & custom integrations</strong
					>
					<span class="mt-2 block max-w-2xl leading-7 text-muted"
						>Connected digital experiences that make all of your tools more
						useful.</span
					>
				</span>
				<span class="service-arrow text-xl text-muted">↗</span>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</div>
